	(text "Excitation regulator (VAA): LT3045, 500 mA.\nVOUT = 100 uA x R_SET. JP6 1-2 bridged (default): R21 100k, 10.0 V.\nCut 1-2 and bridge 2-3: R24 49.9k, 4.99 V. With JP6 open, SET floats up and VAA rises to about VIN - dropout.\nEN/UV and PGFB tie to VIN (power good and fast start-up unused); ILIM to GND = internal current limit.\nC35 >= 10 uF effective at VAA, ESR < 20 mOhm. Kelvin OUTS and the R_SET ground to the load side of C35.\nEight 350 ohm bridges at 10 V draw 229 mA. LT3045 datasheet 3045fa, Pin Functions."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 88.9 45.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ddd1cb34-f926-4c6c-99c8-e2696331b8f9")
	)
